[en.TECHNOLOGY_TECH_MAGI_II]
A.T.O.M.I.C Conceive

[en.TECHNOLOGY_TECH_MAGI_II_desc]
Overcharged Artifact, a weapon of mass destruction based on induced release of energy in magictrons triggered by explosion of artifacts, also known as “Artifact-Triggered Original Magictron Implosion and Collision Bomb” in theoretical terms, abbreviated as “ATOMIC Bomb”.

[zh.TECHNOLOGY_TECH_MAGI_II]
A.T.O.M.I.C构想

[zh.TECHNOLOGY_TECH_MAGI_II_desc]
过充能法器，一种基于引爆法器诱导魔法子能量释放的大规模杀伤性武器，根据其原理又名“原发性魔法子法器诱导内爆碰撞炸弹”，简称“原子弹”。
